	<string name="traffic_explained">This app talks only to these servers:\n\n• Your add-ons (Cinemeta, Torrentio, ThePirateBay+, OpenSubtitles and any you add), for catalogs, details, streams and subtitles.\n• Image servers named by those add-ons, for posters and backgrounds.\n• The stream servers in the links you play, such as your debrid service\'s download servers.\n• Your debrid service\'s API, only when you press Test.\n• The TMDB add-on (tmdb-addon.baby-beamup.club), only when the app isn't in English, for titles, descriptions and episode names in your language.\n• Wikidata (query.wikidata.org), only when the app isn't in English, for titles in your language. Only IMDb ids and your language are sent.\n• Stremio (api.strem.io), only if you sign in, for your add-ons and library.\n• GitHub, only when you check for updates.\n• Other BitTorrent peers, only when you play a torrent with the built-in engine.\n\nThere are no ads, analytics, tracking or crash reports. Your debrid key is stored encrypted and is only ever sent to Torrentio and to your debrid service.</string>

